The patches in this directory modify the Linux kernel and are derivative works
of it.  They are licensed under the kernel's license, GPL-2.0-only (the text is
in ../../LICENSES/GPL-2.0-only.txt), not under the BSD-2-Clause license of the
rest of tinycc-os-kernel.  The `series` file and the directory layout are
BSD-2-Clause like the rest of the repository.
